@architecture.modular-monolith

Purpose:
  Single deployable unit with internal module boundaries.

Owns: references\architecture\modular-monolith.sdd
UseWhen:
  - single team
  - need internal boundaries
  - not ready for distributed systems

AvoidWhen:
  - multiple independent teams
  - need independent scaling

Why:
  Balances simplicity and modularity.

TradeOffs:
  + Simple deployment
  + Easy debugging
  + Internal modularity
  - Limited independent scaling
  - Shared database risk

Related:
  @architecture.microservices
  @ddd.bounded-context

Examples:
  @project.order-management
  @project.payment

State: +
